l right don't race in  Beijing then thank you very much we'll  have much more on the North Korean  missile test coming up at 7:00 a.m. on  CBS this morning our coverage will  continue during the day and our 24-hour  streaming network  cbsn this has been a CBS News special  report  I'm Jeff Glor CBS News in New York we're  news 24 hours a day  go to CBS news.com

